  e6e0ff38bc22f280 t("A runner row is one run. Work facts add which attempt of its task this run is (×N from two) and turn \"Running for\" into the shared time in work: the fixed two-hour alert goes, a long run stands out against the runs on the same page (peerFence). The agent mark moves into the facts. Calls, tokens, CPU, memory and cost stay: Runners is the page for them. Time is always the rightmost fact (owner, 25 Nov): ×N, then the agent mark, then the time, so times line up in one column down the list. ",Inter:$font.family,13:$font.size.md,r,align(l),lh(auto,1.23)) p(32,83) s(1240,hug:48) f[(e98f6bc9eacbf135,tok(fleet.fg-muted,#9A9A9F))] "note"
